00331608"},{"po":18750,"n":"compartment::endoplasmic reticulum","v":"1.330052","d":"double"},{"po":18750,"n":"stringdb::description","v":"Iroquois-class homeodomain protein IRX-3; Transcription factor involved in SHH-dependent neural patterning. Together with NKX2-2 and NKX6-1 acts to restrict the generation of motor neurons to the appropriate region of the neural tube. Belongs to the class I proteins of neuronal progenitor factors, which are repressed by SHH signals. Involved in the transcriptional repression of MNX1 in non-motor neuron cells. Acts as a regulator of energy metabolism."},{"po":18750,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"1.587232","d":"double"},{"po":18750,"n":"display name","v":"IRX3"},{"po":18750,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"1.308973","d":"double"},{"po":18750,"n":"log2FoldChange","v":"1.587210342163046","d":"double"},{"po":18750,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":18750,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"1.676118","d":"double"},{"po":18750,"n":"stringdb::node color","v":"rgb(117,122,239)"},{"po":18750,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000331608"},{"po":18750,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"2.218878","d":"double"},{"po":18750,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"1.180202","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"padj","v":"7.337647532527724E-5","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":18747,"n":"compartment::golgi apparatus","v":"2.003855","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"1.833333","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"2.470064","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["2jq6_A","2ksp_A","AF-Q9H4M9"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":18747,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"1.399393","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"stringdb::species","v":"Homo sapiens"},{"po":18747,"n":"compartment::peroxisome","v":"1.245796","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"tissue::liver","v":"4.525887","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"lfcSE","v":"0.0871691668249004","d":"double"},{"po":18747,"n":"compartment::extracellular","v"