nt signaling. Plays a role in the signal transduction pathways mediated by multiple Wnt genes. Required for LEF1 activation upon WNT1 and WNT3A signaling. DVL1 and PAK1 form a ternary complex with MUSK which is important for MUSK-dependent regulation of AChR clustering during the formation of the neuromuscular junction (NMJ)."},{"po":18588,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"2.253934","d":"double"},{"po":18588,"n":"display name","v":"DVL1"},{"po":18588,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"2.217376","d":"double"},{"po":18588,"n":"tissue::gall bladder","v":"1.54497","d":"double"},{"po":18588,"n":"log2FoldChange","v":"0.808707815630965","d":"double"},{"po":18588,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":18588,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"3.442388","d":"double"},{"po":18588,"n":"stringdb::node color","v":"rgb(239,198,117)"},{"po":18588,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000368166"},{"po":18588,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"2.92488","d":"double"},{"po":18588,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"2.268928","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"padj","v":"1.1886603523206838E-10","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":18585,"n":"compartment::golgi apparatus","v":"0.785999","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"0.954243","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"4.28491","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["AF-P30154"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":18585,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"1.196187","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"stringdb::species","v":"Homo sapiens"},{"po":18585,"n":"tissue::liver","v":"4.533827","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"lfcSE","v":"0.1165221702354643","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"compartment::extracellular","v":"4.25597","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"tissue::stomach","v":"1.543378","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"tissue::bone marrow","v":"1.732808","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"compartment::endosome","v":"0.808831","d":"double"},{"po":18585,"n":"tissue::heart","v":"2.018567","d":"double"},{"